{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/henchGIF.gif?t=1749063894\" /></div><strong>Cyborgs are hunting you down.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/ShootingGifUpdate.gif?t=1749063894\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use your smart pistol to fend them off.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/CarGIF.gif?t=1749063894\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive your hover truck around a violent, bizarre city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/brunGIF.gif?t=1749063894\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chat it up with entertaining characters. Hang out in a mansion or a space ship.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Additional Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story</strong>: Play as a jobless tech worker entangled in a surreal romance with Brunilda, the game designer whose projects have made her the target of a secret society. As her protector, you\u2019ll navigate a decaying city overrun by cybernetic enemies, fragmented memories, and shifting realities. The mysterious forces controlling North Terrace may be impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Sound &amp; Voice Acting</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a haunting original soundtrack and voice-acted dialogue that brings the world and its characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Puzzles &amp; Cryptic Messages</strong> \u2013 Uncover secret paths and decipher clues that pull you deeper into the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Memo &amp; Inventory System</strong> \u2013 Collect memos, essential equipment, and key items to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2293640?t=1749063894","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2293640?t=1749063894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749063894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749063894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2379320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/henchGIF.gif?t=1749063894\" /></div><strong>Cyborgs are hunting you down.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/ShootingGifUpdate.gif?t=1749063894\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use your smart pistol to fend them off.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/CarGIF.gif?t=1749063894\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive your hover truck around a violent, bizarre city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite